request.description:
Returns all SalesMen and ZoneManagers grouped separately.

Returns 404 in Production.

**Response:**
- `salesMen` — array of {id, name, mobileNumber, userType, registrationStatus, isDisabled, assignedCities: [{id, nameAr}]}
- `zoneManagers` — array of {id, name, mobileNumber, userType, registrationStatus, isDisabled, managedRegion: {id, nameAr}}
- `totalSalesMen`, `totalZoneManagers`
